  "description": "Locale context: Invoke LCID German, thread locale en-US. CreateDatabase(path, dbLangGeneral, dbVersion120); CREATE TABLE L (ID LONG primary key, D DOUBLE, C CURRENCY, T DATETIME, B BIT, S TEXT(30)); a dynaset over L with the Fields ID, D, C, T, B and S held. For each text [1,5 ;; 1.5 ;; 1.234,5 ;; 1,234.5 ;; 1 234,5 ;; 2020/03/04 ;; 3/4/2020 ;; 4.3.2020 ;; 13/4/2020 ;; Yes ;; True ;; Wahr ;; -1] (row IDs 1 to 13): AddNew, ID, then the text put to D, C, T and B, Update. For each typed value [Double 1.5 ;; Date 2020-03-04 13:30 ;; Currency 1.5 ;; Boolean True] (IDs 100 to 103): AddNew, ID, the value put to S, Update. For each criterion [D = '1,5' ;; D = '1.5' ;; D = 1.5 ;; C = '1,5' ;; T = '2020/03/04' ;; T = '3/4/2020' ;; S = 1.5 ;; S = '1,5']: FindFirst, NoMatch, ID. Close; for each expression [CDbl('1,5') ;; CDbl('1.5') ;; CCur('1,5') ;; CDate('3/4/2020') ;; CDate('2020/03/04') ;; CStr(1.5) ;; CStr(#2020-03-04 13:30#) ;; CBool('Wahr') ;; '1,5' + 0 ;; Format(1.5) ;; Val('1,5')]: SELECT e FROM L WHERE ID = 1 as a snapshot, read; then SELECT ID, D, C, T, B, S FROM L ORDER BY ID read to EOF. Asks which locale each conversion takes.",
